
; Configuration file with names/phone numbers for the terminal.

; Not Case dependant (Upper/Lower case is not a problem)
; Replace spaces in names with underscores
; First entry on a line is the 'nice name' for logging and displaying.
; Last entry on a line is the phone number.
; Use ^^ for a phone number to send a ^ to the modem for fax tones while
; dialing (to bypass BBSes with one line and a fax selector)


